  data: {
    LLM: "Don't waste your trumps early. Use low-value cards (6, 5, 4, 3) to probe your opponents and safe-guard your points.\n\nStrategic Passing: Since you don't have to follow suit, use your point-cards (Ace/7) to win tricks that contain high-value discards from your partner.\n\nCard Counting: There are only 36 cards. If you track the fallen 10s and face cards, you can calculate precisely when it's safe to drop your 7s.",
    Player: "Don't waste your trumps early. Use low-value cards (6, 5, 4, 3) to probe your opponents and safe-guard your points.\n\nStrategic Passing: Since you don't have to follow suit, use your point-cards (Ace/7) to win tricks that contain high-value discards from your partner.\n\nCard Counting: There are only 36 cards. If you track the fallen 10s and face cards, you can calculate precisely when it's safe to drop your 7s.",
